# Geofence drawing tool (Lab 11a) — example environment
#
# Copy to .env.  The only value compose reads is the published port.
# Everything about the map itself (tile source, opening view, coordinate
# precision) lives in the CONFIG block at the top of www/index.html.

# Published port for the drawing tool.  2023 sits next to the other map
# stacks (Lab 15 tile server 2020/2021, Lab 16 viewer 2022) and out of
# the crowded 808x band.  Override if 2023 is already in use on this host.
DRAW_TOOL_PORT=2023
